   "question": "<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf M=\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;1&amp;4\\\\k&amp;2&amp;-2\\\\4&amp;1&amp;-2\\end{pmatrix}\\qquad\\mathbf N=\\begin{pmatrix}k-7&amp;6&amp;-10\\\\2&amp;-20&amp;24\\\\-3&amp;2&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\"></span> is a constant.</p><ol class=\"parts\" type=\"a\"><li>Determine, in simplest form in terms of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\"></span>, the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf{M\\,N}\"></span>. <span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li><li>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k=5\"></span><ol class=\"parts\" type=\"i\"><li>write down <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf{M\\,N}\"></span></li><li>hence write down <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf M^{-1}\"></span></li></ol><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li><li>Solve the simultaneous equations<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{aligned}2x+\\ \\ y+4z&amp;=2\\\\5x+2y-2z&amp;=3\\\\4x+\\ \\ y-2z&amp;=-1\\end{aligned}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li><li>Interpret the answer to part (c) geometrically. <span class=\"marks\">(1)</span></li></ol>",
